@node SCI Frontend
@chapter SCI Frontend Language

SCI is a scripting language used in the Sierra Creative Interpreter for adventure
game development. The EIGHTBOL SCI frontend compiles SCI scripts to support
retro game development on 8-bit and 16-bit platforms. This chapter documents the
complete SCI language grammar, statements, expressions, types, and examples.

