@node SCI Lexical Elements
@section Lexical Elements

@subsection Keywords

SCI reserves the following keywords (case-insensitive):

@table @code
@item and, or, not
Logical operators
@item break, continue
Loop control
@item class
Class definition
@item cond
Conditional
@item define
Symbolic constant
@item do, else, elseif, endif
Conditional constructs
@item enum
Enumeration
@item for, forall
Iteration
@item goto
Jump statement
@item if, ifnot, else, elif
Conditionals
@item instance, method
OOP declarations
@item local, param
Variable declarations
@item private, public, protected
Access modifiers
@item procedure
Procedure definition
@item return
Function return
@item self, rest
Special parameters
@item species
Base class
@item switch, case
Case statement
@item to, from, by
Range specification
@item while, repeat
Loop constructs
@end table

@subsection Identifiers

Identifiers follow standard C-like conventions:

@itemize
@item Case-insensitive
@item Start with letter or underscore
@item Contain alphanumerics, underscores
@item Examples: @code{Player}, @code{_hp}, @code{score123}
@end itemize

